    email: thong@lbl.gov
license: BSD-3-Clause-LBNL
repository-code: "https://github.com/LBNL-HongTeam/STLF-MCP-Server"
abstract: >-
  STLF-MCP is an open-source Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes
  a short-term electrical load forecasting workflow to AI assistants. Its tools
  inspect interval-meter data, merge weather covariates, train and tune 12
  forecasting algorithms, evaluate point and probabilistic forecasts with
  peak-day metrics, run rolling-window backtests, generate forecasts, and
  produce self-contained HTML reports.
keywords:
  - short-term load forecasting
  - Model Context Protocol
  - advanced metering infrastructure
  - time series
  - machine learning
